# ValaryArena

Guida completa: `AGENTS.md`. JAR proprio, package `com.valaryrpg.arena`. Non è un modulo Core.

- Testi/permessi/suoni/delay/coord/cap/nomi spawner → YAML. Java orchestra.
- Brand e separator solo in `lang/messages.yml`.
- Helper: `Tasks`, `MessageService`, `SoundService`, `ConsoleCommands`, `StorageManager`.
- Async: copy/delete mondo, SQL kill/milestone. Sync: load/unload, TP, Mythic.
- Max 4 istanze per boss. Coda RAM, dequeue sull’unload. Niente `PlayerMoveEvent`.
- Kill/milestone **per player**. Hologram TextDisplay solo su `ACTIVE`.
- Cap `max-bosses` → stop spawner + TP fuori. Cooldown entry/between in `arenas.yml`.
- Reward Core = `[console]` in `milestones.yml`. Mai compileOnly sul Core.
- v1: party, istanze, coda, kill/milestone, holo, cap, cooldown. Niente shop/wave/spectator/editor.
